/-!
# The cascade's landing: frozen readings [1, 2, 3, 4, 5] and a mover ρ > 1 (GENERATED by `s1_gen_lean_landing_v2.py`)

Written 2026-10-22.  New file.  Lonely pieces of the frozen set from `1/(8·1)` (exact): [1/8, 7/40].
The landing is the first lonely instant of the frozen set with the mover (`landSpecG12345`); by `cascade_landsG` it is the fixed
point of every cascade run from `1/(8·1)`.  Grades: [L]; gap covers [PROVISIONAL: covering]; `holdG12345_exists`
[PROVISIONAL: counting tool].  The cascade's intermediate setters are not claimed.
